   ```bash
   peer bgp-ls-group enable
   ```

7. **Optional: Apply Route Policies**:
   ```bash
   peer bgp-ls-group route-policy <policy-name> export  # Outbound policy
   peer bgp-ls-group route-policy <policy-name> import  # Inbound policy
   ```

8. **Commit and Verify**:
