    peer <eBGP_PEER_IP> route-policy Prefer_eBGP import
   ```
   - Replace `<AS_NUMBER>` with your BGP AS number.
   - Replace `<eBGP_PEER_IP>` with the IP of the external BGP neighbor.

### Example:
