   ```

### 3. **Enable BGP Multipath with Relaxed AS-Path Comparison**
   - Allow multiple paths even if AS paths differ:
     ```bash
     [Huawei-bgp-af-vpnv6] bestroute as-path multipath-relax
     [Huawei-bgp-af-vpnv6] maximum load-balancing <number>
     ```
     - `<number>`: Set the maximum number of parallel paths (e.g., `2`).

### 4. **Adjust Local Preference (Optional)**
   - If iBGP routes are preferred due to higher Local Preference, create a route-policy to lower their priority:
     ```bash
     [Huawei] route-policy iBGP-LOW-PREF permit node 10
     [Huawei-route-policy] if as-path-filter 1
     [Huawei-route-policy] apply local-preference 80
     [Huawei-route-policy] quit
     [Huawei] route-policy iBGP-LOW-PREF permit node 20
     [Huawei-route-policy] quit
     [Huawei] as-path-filter 1 permit ^<AS-number>$  # Match iBGP routes
