To configure a Huawei router in the BGP VPNv4 address family to allow the selection of sub-optimal external (EBGP) routes when the preferred internal (IBGP) route is unavailable, follow these steps:

### 1. **Enter BGP Configuration Mode**
```bash
system-view
bgp <AS-number>
