    apply local-priority (500 * med) + (200 * igp_metric)
  end-policy
  ```
  However, Huawei’s CLI may not support `igp_metric` as a variable.

### Conclusion:
While Huawei routers do not natively support the exact formula, the provided workaround using extended communities is the closest feasible method. Adjustments may be needed based on network design and Huawei software version capabilities.
