- **MED Handling:** The `med-plus-igp` command adds the IGP cost to the MED. By scaling MED (×500) and IGP metrics (×200), the formula becomes **(MED × 500) + (IGP × 200)**.
- **Limitations:** This method assumes control over IGP metric configurations. If scaling IGP metrics isn't feasible, consider alternative BGP attributes like Local Preference or AS Path manipulation.
