How to configure a Huawei router running BGP-IPv6 unicast to advertise only routes that are both selected by BGP and active in the IP routing table?


To configure a Huawei router running BGP-IPv6 unicast to advertise only routes that are both selected by BGP and active in the IP routing table, follow these steps:

