   system-view
   bgp <AS-number>
   ```

2. **Enter the IPv6 unicast address family view**:
   ```bash
   ipv6-family unicast
   ```

3. **Enable the advertisement of active routes for each BGP peer**:
   ```bash
   peer <IPv6-address> advertise-rib-active
   ```
   Replace `<IPv6-address>` with the actual IPv6 address of your BGP peer. Repeat this command for each peer as needed.

**Example Configuration**:
