- Check the BGP table to see validation statuses:
  ```bash
  display bgp routing-table ipv4
  ```
- Inspect route policies:
  ```bash
  display route-policy VALID_PREFERENCE
  ```

This setup ensures origin validation influences route preference while maintaining Invalid routes as fallback options.
