To enable the exchange of IPv4 Prefix SIDs with an IPv6 BGP peer group named "bgp-srv6-group" on a Huawei router, follow these configuration steps:

### 1. **Enable SRv6 and Configure a Locator**
```huawei
<Router> system-view
