- **IPv4 Labeled Unicast**: Enables the exchange of IPv4 routes with labels. The `prefix-sid` command attaches SRv6 SIDs to IPv4 prefixes advertised to the peer group.

This setup allows IPv4 routes to be advertised over an IPv6 BGP session with SRv6 Prefix SIDs, enabling seamless integration in an SRv6 core.
