    segment-routing ipv4 locator VPN_CORE_LOCATOR
    peer VPN_CORE enable
    peer VPN_CORE advertise-srgb
    peer VPN_CORE prefix-sid
   ```
   - `segment-routing ipv4 locator` binds the locator to the address family.
   - `advertise-srgb` advertises the Segment Routing Global Block.
