  peer 192.168.5.9 as-number <PEER_AS_NUMBER>  # Define BGP peer if not already configured
  ipv4-family unicast  # Enter IPv4 address family
    peer 192.168.5.9 enable  # Activate the peer for IPv4
    peer 192.168.5.9 route-policy filter-inbound import  # Apply inbound policy
  commit  # Save changes
```

### Explanation:
- **Route-Policy**: 
  - Node 10 permits routes matching the prefix-list `ALLOWED-ROUTES`.
  - Node 20 explicitly denies all other routes (implicitly denied by default, but explicit for clarity).
- **BGP Configuration**: 
