- **`ip ip-prefix`**: Defines a prefix list to match specific routes.
- **`route-policy`**: Creates a policy with nodes to permit/deny routes based on conditions.
- **`peer <ip> route-policy export`**: Applies the policy to routes sent to the specified BGP peer.

