- Check the BGP routing table to confirm the priorities:
  ```bash
  display bgp routing-table ipv4
  ```

**Note**: Ensure there are no conflicting route policies that might override these settings. This configuration applies to all routes in the IPv4 unicast address family. Adjust the AS number according to your network setup.
